
# API Documentation

## Backend API Endpoints

The backend is built with **Express.js** and provides a RESTful API for the frontend.

### Authentication (`/api/auth`)

*   `POST /register`: Register a new user.
*   `POST /login`: Log in a user and return a JWT.
*   `POST /logout`: Log out a user.
*   `GET /profile`: Get the profile of the currently authenticated user.
*   `PUT /profile`: Update the profile of the currently authenticated user.
*   `POST /forgot-password`: (Placeholder) Initiate a password reset.
*   `POST /reset-password`: (Placeholder) Reset a user's password.

### Users (`/api/users`)

*   `GET /`: (Placeholder) Get a list of users.
*   `GET /health`: Health check for the users module.

### Admin (`/api/admin`)

*   `GET /users`: Get a list of all users.
*   `POST /users`: Create a new user.
*   `PUT /users/:id`: Update a user.
*   `DELETE /users/:id`: Delete a user.
*   `POST /users/:id/reset-password`: Reset a user's password.
*   `GET /analytics`: Get platform analytics.
*   `GET /health`: Health check for the admin module.
*   `GET /diagnostics`: Get health checks for all modules.

### Tracks (`/api/tracks`)

*   `GET /`: Get all active career tracks.
*   `GET /:id`: Get a specific career track by ID.
*   `GET /health`: Health check for the tracks module.

### Curriculum (`/api/curriculum`)

*   `GET /`: Get all curriculum items, optionally filtered by career track.
*   `GET /:id`: Get a specific curriculum item by ID.
*   `POST /`: (Admin) Create a new curriculum item.
*   `PUT /:id`: (Admin) Update a curriculum item.
*   `DELETE /:id`: (Admin) Delete a curriculum item.
*   `POST /:id/learn`: (Admin) Add a "learn" item to a curriculum item.
*   `PUT /:id/learn/:learnIdx`: (Admin) Update a "learn" item.
*   `DELETE /:id/learn/:learnIdx`: (Admin) Delete a "learn" item.
*   `POST /:id/test`: (Admin) Add a "test" item to a curriculum item.
*   `PUT /:id/test/:testIdx`: (Admin) Update a "test" item.
*   `DELETE /:id/test/:testIdx`: (Admin) Delete a "test" item.
*   `POST /:id/exercise`: (Admin) Add an "exercise" item to a curriculum item.
*   `PUT /:id/exercise/:exerciseIdx`: (Admin) Update an "exercise" item.
*   `DELETE /:id/exercise/:exerciseIdx`: (Admin) Delete an "exercise" item.
*   `GET /health`: Health check for the curriculum module.

### AI (`/api/ai`)

*   `POST /chat`: Send a message to the AI chat mentor.
*   `GET /health`: Health check for the AI service.

### Attendance (`/api/attendance`)

*   `POST /mark`: Mark a student's attendance.
*   `GET /:userId`: Get the attendance records for a specific user.

### Settings (`/api/admin/settings`)

*   `GET /`: (Admin) Get platform settings.
*   `PUT /`: (Admin) Update platform settings.
*   `GET /health`: Health check for the settings module.
